' sub.columns: a list in 1-4 columns for the caller's width (11/20/2026, the
' user's design). im loads it through line 432 (a$="columns":goto 74), so
' an i. or i/ module calls it with im=1:gosub 432. The routine itself is
' columns.lbl (11/23/2026), which sub.info and sub.param1 include too and
' call without loading this (a sub module calling another through im 432 had
' it take its place, and im 75 load it again afterwards). What it takes and
' does: columns.lbl.

{uses:..\3_0-preface.lbl}
{alpha:alt}
{include:"..\asm\equates.asm"}
{crunch:on}

60000 on im gosub 61800:return
60990 rem "sub.columns 11/23/2026"
{include:columns.lbl}
